Notes / decisions the plan didn't specify
- I pruned expired entries inside `set` before deciding whether eviction is needed, so a lingering expired entry can never cause a live entry to be evicted.
- `get`/`has`/`delete` lazily remove an expired entry when they encounter it; `size` only counts and does not mutate.
- Work is on branch `implement-cache` with two commits: `Implement LRU cache with expiry` and `Add cache tests`.

